sentences.text:
1  (BY SMT. ANITA M. REDDY, HCGP FOR R-1;
 NOTICE TO R-2 SERVED)
 -2-  NC: 2023:KHC-K:8601  CRL.P No. 201067 of 2023  THIS CRL.P IS FILED U/S. 439 OF CR.P.C PRAYING TO RELEASE THE PETITIONER ON BAIL IN CRIME No.27/2022 OF MAHAGAON P.S, DIST.KALABURAGI, PENDING ON THE FILE OF ADDITIONAL DISTRICT AND SESSIONS JUDGE AND FTSC-I (POCSO) KALABURAGI IN SPL.CASE POCSO NO.13 /2023, FOR THE OFFENCES PUNISHABLE U/SEC. 363, 344, 376(2)(n) OF I.P.C. AND SEC.4 AND 6 OF POCSO ACT, 2012, IN THE INTEREST OF JUSTICE.

The petitioner-accused is ordered to be released on bail by the Trial Court in Crime No.27/2022 registered by Mahagaon police station, Gulbarga Rural Circle, Kalaburagi, pending on the file of Additional District and Sessions Judge, FTSC-1(POCSO), Kalaburagi in Spl.Case POCSO No.13/2013, subject to the following conditions:
(i) Petitioner-accused shall execute a personal bond for a sum of Rs.2,00,000/-
 (Rupees Two Lakhs only) with two  sureties for the likesum to the  satisfaction of the trial Court;
(ii) Petitioner shall not indulge in similar offences strictly;
NC: 2023:KHC-K:8601 (iii) Petitioner shall not tamper with the prosecution witnesses directly/ indirectly;
(iv) Petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction without prior permission of the trial Court.

